------------------------------------------------------------
EV – Electric Vehicle
HV battery – High Voltage battery
LV battery – Low Voltage (12V) battery
AC – Alternating Current
DC – Direct Current

------------------------------
OBC – On Board Charger
PDU – Power Distribution Unit
VCU – Vehicle Control Unit
BMS - Battery Management System
OBD - On Board Diagnostics

------------------------------
SoC – State of Charge
SRS – Supplementary Restraint System
CRS - Child Restraint System
DAB – Driver Airbag
PAB – Passenger Airbag

------------------------------
ABS - Anti-lock Braking System
EBD - Electronic Brake Force Distribution
ESC - Electronic Stability Control
PEPS - Passive Entry/Passive Start
BCM - Body Control Module

------------------------------
POT - Power Operated Tailgate
UID - User Identification Device
ESCL – Electronic Steering Column Lock
EPAS – Electric Power Assisted Steering
LED – Light Emitting Diode

------------------------------
DRL – Daytime Running Lamp
ORVM - Outer Rear View Mirror
IRVM – Inside Rear View Mirror
EC-IRVM – Electric Chromic Inside Rear View Mirror
HVAC – Heating Ventilation and Air Con-ditioning

------------------------------
FATC – Fully Automatic Temperature Control
DIS – Driver Information System
DTE - Distance to Empty
IGN – Ignition
ACC – Accessory

------------------------------
EPB – Electronic Parking Brake (EPB)
CPL – Centre Position Lamp
V2L – Vehicle to Load
V2V – Vehicle to Vehicle
ADAS - Advanced Driver Assistance Sys-tems

------------------------------
AVAS - Acoustic Vehicle Alerting System
iVBAC - Intelligent Vacuum-less Boost & Active Control

